    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just not just about being tired though. i mean, i look at them and i see how much they struggle because of me. like my sister, she’s always stressed, my parents are always worrying... i feel like if i was just gone, that weight would lift off them. wouldn't it be easier for them if they didn't have to worry about me anymore?",
